e line cannot attribute two arms, split the constructions\",\n351|\t\t\t\tfirst, describeArm(arm), site)\n352|\t\t}\n353|\t\tseenLines[site] = describeArm(arm)\n354|\t}\n355|\treturn arms\n356|}\n357|\n358|// refusalConstructorSpec is the core watch list for this package:\n359|// package-local refusal constructors plus the plain-error spellings by\n360|// import path, so an import alias cannot change what the audit sees. The\n361|// union keeps terminalbackend's outright refusal and resolves the\n362|// import-alias and var-binding shapes that walked through every\n363|// identifier-keyed gate in this repository.\n364|//\n365|// refuse joins the local set: every production &Error literal routes\n(more lines below)"}}}
