bed by the bare-name dedupe; P3 dead multi-line BackendID arm missed by the line-text filter. Post-fix both RED in one `TestBackendIDEntryCensus` run: `has no census pair` for the multiline site, `collide on one bare name: Reconcile: Reconcile in manifest.go against Registry.Reconcile in manifest.go`. Plants reverted byte-identical (`git diff` shows no PLANT; full suite green).\n+- EVIDENCE: outcome `TASK-260906-2okwyf_outcome-r4.md` + `TASK-260906-2okwyf_battery-r4.json` + `TASK-260906-2okwyf_mutants-r4.json` (r4: 5 applied — narrowing 2, arm-deletion 2, census-only 1 — 4 killed / 1 survived with a plant-evidenced bound; NOT_APPLIED/COMPILE_FAIL distinct controls; masks non-empty: census 15, behav 32). Continuity re-runs on this tree: r1 9/9, r2 5/5, r3 6/6 killed, 0 survived — cumulative 24/25 with the single survivor D-tb-entryindex-enforce (0 live collisions; P2 plant GREEN without the gate, RED with it). N3 deliberately left open with the 0-of-44 sweep bound. Candidate tree OID in the outcome doc, detached-index write-tree AFTER this append, `ls-tree` read back against the scope enumeration both directions.\n+- GATES: `go test ./...` exit 0 (23 ok, 0 FAIL), `-race` terminalbackend exit 0, `-cover` exit 0 (tb 95.4%, ph 86.0%, pv 97.8%), `go vet ./...` exit 0, `GOOS=windows go vet` (tb/ph/pv) exit 0, `go build` + `GOOS=windows go build` exit 0, gofmt clean.\n+- STATUS: Ready for review, handed off to review (review/integration are orchestrator steps).\n+\n+### 1015 — 2okwyf round 3: F2 instrument — Reconcile entry gate plus (site, entry) census, 41/41\n"}}}
